# Local Transcription Quality Correction

Status: DONE
Milestone: Q2 Accurate local final transcripts
Dependencies: 26_MICROPHONE_AND_COMPUTER.todo (reference-only)

## Purpose

Replace poor actual-use recognition with a genuinely improved local recognition path, not phrase substitutions.

## Tasks

- [x] Implement an accurate local final-recognition mode with explicit verified model provisioning.
- [x] Preserve provisional/final identity, per-source offsets, stop drain, bounds and v1/v2 schemas.
- [x] Ensure compute cannot silently drop or indefinitely queue audio.
- [x] Detect stale runtime/model configuration and replace only an authenticated owned idle service.
- [x] Measure provided Two Sum wording plus independent synthetic technical/noise controls.
- [x] Log metadata for engine/model/decode/audio duration and faults; no raw audio by default.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Report all before/after results and end-of-speech-to-final measurements, not batch RTF as live latency.
- [x] No hardcoded correction to the expected phrase, silent fallback or cloud-audio upload.
- [x] Synthetic results do not claim real-microphone or accent qualification.

